      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我们唱歌我们跳舞，祝贺大家新年好！",
      "traditional": "我們唱歌我們跳舞，祝賀大家新年好！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men chàng gē wǒ men tiào wǔ zhù hè dà jiā xīn nián hǎo",
      "english": "Happy new year, happy new year, we wish everyone a happy new year."
    },
